      "id": 1,
      "text": "Manns Choice earned its name when Congressman Job Mann pushed for a post office in 1848, and the village was officially called Mann's Choice before the name stuck.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        21,
        22,
        23
      ],
